  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "7d2977bc-1e78-4897-a2e3-40d82de34b23",
      "title": "Leia a situação e acompanhe três pistas ao longo da aula: o que saiu do plano, qual é a consequência e como a rota muda.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "b8598e42-b6e5-4855-b029-1a851b9a67f3",
          "textContent": "<p>Você vai acompanhar mensagens curtas de uma pessoa a caminho do centro.</p><p>O plano inicial funciona por pouco tempo, aparece um contratempo e a rota precisa mudar.</p><p>Nesta aula, o fio da leitura é sempre o mesmo: <strong>problema</strong>, <strong>consequência</strong> e <strong>ajuste</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8d1b2416-3764-496b-9352-263f59b490a4",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue a expressão ao momento em que o plano inicial precisa mudar.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c042a019-b680-48dd-8c1c-5cecd65b11d2",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe a frase.</p><p><strong>Tengo que cambiar de plan.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Tenho que mudar de plano.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/74eef9a04d23484aa3e05d3c03323968_b02-cambiar-de-plan-scene-phase4.png?Expires=1794099617&Signature=DJyns0mY4bcSyUA7H2lVFd69vpsdxaiUYrod1PiKN49V08OuugvF-wpXmr2bVwMpFaFqfMyhmbWCqujeY6kU4tPR4g3Qb7QrGzjyK~KQ8S7YZ2j5quCCy5-ChW2YD33MWzfEEcbynW-G7cvn30Hk7HTa1vrApXalodNg1yDmCGPO1Zv76Wf0p3Dm8VK2uDVNA5eDnEeN4P8~88FsXndFF4mdNKVjTX~s0H01V3nLnl7CzKCtCElOvsfl-DQhMbiQwruPW8ZqqPE3LtpuKa6fptJbgZ9uAXoEac9jwEw~ohDyb2G292E~yRzDsrQmKWbPNlcMtWh8BiBrBvVrDvz7Ug__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/550a9346ef884d389688f98200e99f26_b02-tengo-que-cambiar-de-plan-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=xK2aFzz2aCk~hqNhVCAEmRsCp8px-b2k5zhoyTS0OF~YOv9mCqu~L4~cJS0I7XqF95Nc5053asG7LwHIL~tDsHZHYZSWjQ8u7c5cLoKBuJT3m12yleB2lipVXATIkcbyBtCMhdPIuNxomeOs9c2gimsKdLG3d9Qa1YlMRv3ZwOx7gl2SSTWv7W4uuW9jEtiaOCbGOeh3Nj0A~0ZEDxEZcDcMre714d9YDit-H7zMTr4D4IJoYDqCmv92NrZuJxj7p2nUHCdrRzQt-2zjeBiqhfgOcYWSGhjcene7nykhgk0ZZ~6hcVv25TJFamYTkakx0g9qOZPVtk58h9-OJyVW7A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "59d57e61-6e5f-465c-8339-edc1da39bc91",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe que essa expressão anuncia a mudança antes de explicar a causa exata.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f48f6feb-4cb2-458e-ae07-39225aeba2ea",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>cambiar de plan</strong> aparece quando o trajeto ou o horário não pode continuar do jeito pensado antes.</p><p>Essa frase costuma vir cedo na mensagem, antes de explicar exatamente o que deu errado.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3e8aa976-73a6-403c-9e4a-19b4cb8a4709",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e ligue perder ao momento em que a pessoa não consegue pegar o transporte.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3dfd1a85-a094-45c1-a775-743f08b378bc",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o problema fica concreto.</p><p><strong>Perdí el autobús.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Perdi o ônibus.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/412ab984e8c94983a36f076db736150b_b04-perder-el-autobus-scene-phase4.png?Expires=1794099617&Signature=z92~XwQzfsu5YPkCp7yD4Wb5TUVsJ-VYLvuMe70sz~KZsZ1pX4sfzLqMaFGXwzkQCtG9fa8bC76qk~853Sp5D-K6E3r0IJmR3Ax8AXq653BafoxMFtxfQdrXxRW9sw4XOqrymHeqtj6uZaDVCN-LKNo8P39lCdtC9wIz946Vbs63IzjPc3s8ZS7pHLyFxC02jHao424VmgrzO2UzPnKvSzyuwuqrmVK6yNmWs~CeUE~qnrE8SAYCsBNAFg5sNiLnC480Mua6cecJCHekljuMvyi2KUSejgdVQ4XGvFaQJoSDvQtTje8X07ixjhLs-Tysp9mAA4OsXWmHzPDRVbDyxg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9fae3d0eb3fb4b04bced3ddf7d397ffd_b04-perdi-el-autobus-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=tf4NsqjDc5Tjc7mIVTXzQ9axX2WNNsp2Vt2q9kJc0b~t8CzFJxuACeFSihOq81SgUEh54zrvbi9QdK1k4aSsYN0XZN6NnY7i7MyISYr8DkaBXkAvURMnMh5R2UpqtriaPULxzSgAyK-gHPBzyJzFnQhBD8sJYoHPp6s0fHgdRW4lYp-CC6f9TdHju6SlEX6XraziJlZ~h49JDFaNjzmdty3ZPpG2tSDp~kwNkVF83pU8J12YjpvMoQ~-yiKfhslUWcC9~pNbumx7Xm-g3YR97b9q2xmopCayeTRi32qwB1loyOmutJK25Jf~K0CNd2HPl0EW1z1lEeqq5qjk35Fo8Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3a21e2aa-de16-4b87-bf09-52ef5a330b63",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e note que agora a mensagem mostra a consequência do contratempo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9ddbed26-c09f-426e-96dc-afecd9e5bb6e",
          "textContent": "<p>Depois do problema, vem a consequência.</p><p><strong>Voy a llegar tarde.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Vou chegar atrasada.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/0b32a50af79b4483985862e3624a4a8b_b05-llegar-tarde-scene-phase4.png?Expires=1794099617&Signature=qRiVZicqE8ySUkzLWhO9Z~TZexQyzMSrKfseczFvKXUgjz8SQD1USxgq5kcxuCwqm049QpxNNuR2yQ1~GEfAW-jP3SmPpBxc~bkhImvq1J-FrD6Qk6QIeJ6Ev~Ij9GnkvGvsvm7ON6EuHkN7bbGYladVXr3jGDnLWmAU1Mq5k6mrotX9Zbx8opt~0gTygbEk0xccI4xrEijAEVRssJMudF4GydAQMcmJvmLc5fupsxS50crUJ0USpxUmEOVJMueUhq2765L8LbEyFdQvrBk1VcSgkQdn79slTvEdUmOPQkhGWeCoYunsMqJFmI4lKeAAz4PBOndjtBq8m5x2DKZ8Jg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c8ae7bdb112c4aa6a9fe24f1ae72c7dc_b05-voy-a-llegar-tarde-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=CJJiqzkXYEJiMGG8FY9nf387fTM0at-Y-P~NjjmcKElNkT7BtmbX6DkfmLizt9nZh-FIrKerSVWbXINxP7oQa7Lq7cD3fzuIj7XPQpyLIJ1UxfARYIDomP9XfHW8FHAc9mBPrMcHbBVMG1B0JZXwBBmHxpE44jU9O1tjsAk9W3Kbl0gAOeQ-KW86tIgljNfK5GFYqsz8XLZsK1Ma-JK7k6lkAk4j3CsfPzVd9vt6QARhv-lS7PETjNJsPz7UjAXIK-Fod8VmdlyOzGxUniEB8B3ENvOT9hxKJhFK~nY3EmyYPo92IJZ1k5MzagTlYODXepnOYN8aouDwE5~xVg2j9Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3c9178c1-91e4-4cef-b925-c4d57c2b5140",
      "title": "Leia a nota curta e observe a diferença entre nomear o contratempo e avisar a sua consequência.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9582f120-52b7-4fa9-ae5d-e75c5da88e9c",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>perder</strong> nomeia o que falhou no trajeto.</p><p><strong>llegar tarde</strong> mostra a consequência desse problema.</p><p>Em uma atualização curta, primeiro você diz o que perdeu e depois avisa o atraso.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f4b66373-3c43-44f5-85e4-798dd528e4e5",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a frase e perceba que a pessoa já está procurando uma alternativa para seguir o trajeto.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5b022d48-62bc-425e-8d2d-df70901f622b",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a mensagem mostra o ajuste.</p><p><strong>Estoy buscando otra ruta.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Estou procurando outra rota.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/47e9b947ac7b4d329854d74a54117f17_b07-buscar-otra-ruta-scene-phase4.png?Expires=1794099617&Signature=Q~KdrsV7TzgDl42NZl7vJEkX3z3YTiMvYjoyjlBdndRsDT4sW7rW5oOLTCoiSJg3wM5CFt3gV0QWK5NZcwS0BBTurUJLCXOnWn8QeEwJrkKjLoaZpYkCafxVUi7ncIdWVfDZz4IdCuOPlIZyKfOGgY7ENuwF~9lwDjtoZgfZMm4nkS0VJ7bTQhh858qA4~Xnh2sThRkGCkoqelS3A6Gcv-RgLZ0PCrsxsScRABXEWVz3Lpjp7Z-b5~2LQeBaqG~6DyTH9~YPjtKoHbOjGCVPOYTaYOwQBSWFREAXfK1g7QJZAJWtZ7nphzgqLWvzRhwzAjE32l7p0nUdoO1lr0MbbA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c4bfd559651c4d4fa77bb6de2f327e56_b07-estoy-buscando-otra-ruta-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=aUd3f-KIUeGVxWD5iEzoig~lMl6bVwo8OzxKXjJB3M~P3MofLeU-6JViA8tKRP~qtGHqYFV9qyYG1EPBmrFPM3txEGiMparFJUTW25B4nj5Dun0ouqKHV0hEZW1FwBky~rxby8dVqQxEFEYOOzfL9g02eSvqlRjfmeE3L7mo2u3RjoGk6Ma9B24h0Oig9Byy2p3bk7saOykMHCo7O1gdEmTQjv4b0pyBLhv8vDky3QnlP4k3G4tSB~Hcy6xQE~BXotYPiZqcEICLIb~BUNKAMgSOrNr7XwJcMeC6qSxemqphKFZwTSbxP7oZkQtaMEaHnV1szxWPNDAwAoSj7JHBzA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bdfbc08b-ab80-41b2-8896-c840be08445a",
      "title": "Leia a frase e observe como pero marca a quebra entre o que estava pensado e o que aconteceu no caminho.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 8,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c1b1f690-4950-4222-be6b-b88eb7d7e5dd",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Tenía pensado ir en autobús, pero perdí el autobús.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu tinha pensado em ir de ônibus, mas perdi o ônibus.</strong></p><p><strong>pero</strong> marca a quebra entre o plano inicial e o problema que muda o percurso.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2398cb8b-e7bc-4213-bb5d-66b335facf9c",
      "title": "Leia a frase e observe como al final fecha a mensagem sem voltar a contar todo o problema.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 9,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f281aba8-9f07-48c3-85dc-25efbdbfb48c",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Al final, voy en metro.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>No fim, vou de metrô.</strong></p><p><strong>al final</strong> leva a leitura para o resultado real, depois do ajuste de rota.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "4c266680-2561-40b9-b4a9-1f6129fb7090",
      "title": "Leia a atualização completa e observe a ordem que você pode reaproveitar em uma mensagem real.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 10,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e130cb73-434f-4af6-96bc-1d8201b32030",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Tengo que cambiar de plan. Tenía pensado ir en autobús, pero perdí el autobús.</strong></p><p><strong>Voy a llegar tarde y estoy buscando otra ruta.</strong></p><p><strong>Al final, voy en metro.</strong></p><p>O texto fica curto porque avança em uma ordem clara: aviso de mudança, plano inicial, problema, consequência, ajuste e resultado.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "52ef1e16-ac05-4bc3-95c8-8196e8de0efa",
      "title": "Passe pelos itens finais e observe como cada parte ajuda a montar uma mensagem curta de deslocamento real.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 11,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a46bbb4e-2719-45df-bc1d-cbd57e42666b",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Tengo que cambiar de plan.</strong></p><p>Serve para avisar que o plano inicial deixou de funcionar.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/550a9346ef884d389688f98200e99f26_b02-tengo-que-cambiar-de-plan-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=xK2aFzz2aCk~hqNhVCAEmRsCp8px-b2k5zhoyTS0OF~YOv9mCqu~L4~cJS0I7XqF95Nc5053asG7LwHIL~tDsHZHYZSWjQ8u7c5cLoKBuJT3m12yleB2lipVXATIkcbyBtCMhdPIuNxomeOs9c2gimsKdLG3d9Qa1YlMRv3ZwOx7gl2SSTWv7W4uuW9jEtiaOCbGOeh3Nj0A~0ZEDxEZcDcMre714d9YDit-H7zMTr4D4IJoYDqCmv92NrZuJxj7p2nUHCdrRzQt-2zjeBiqhfgOcYWSGhjcene7nykhgk0ZZ~6hcVv25TJFamYTkakx0g9qOZPVtk58h9-OJyVW7A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "38670e80-4e77-4fdc-80be-a6943a9974df",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Perdí el autobús.</strong></p><p>Nomeia o problema concreto do trajeto.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9fae3d0eb3fb4b04bced3ddf7d397ffd_b04-perdi-el-autobus-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=tf4NsqjDc5Tjc7mIVTXzQ9axX2WNNsp2Vt2q9kJc0b~t8CzFJxuACeFSihOq81SgUEh54zrvbi9QdK1k4aSsYN0XZN6NnY7i7MyISYr8DkaBXkAvURMnMh5R2UpqtriaPULxzSgAyK-gHPBzyJzFnQhBD8sJYoHPp6s0fHgdRW4lYp-CC6f9TdHju6SlEX6XraziJlZ~h49JDFaNjzmdty3ZPpG2tSDp~kwNkVF83pU8J12YjpvMoQ~-yiKfhslUWcC9~pNbumx7Xm-g3YR97b9q2xmopCayeTRi32qwB1loyOmutJK25Jf~K0CNd2HPl0EW1z1lEeqq5qjk35Fo8Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "b8232665-3405-47f2-8f5c-87f8ee719017",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Voy a llegar tarde.</strong></p><p>Ajuda a avisar a consequencia do contratempo.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/c8ae7bdb112c4aa6a9fe24f1ae72c7dc_b05-voy-a-llegar-tarde-phase4.mp3?Expires=1794099617&Signature=CJJiqzkXYEJiMGG8FY9nf387fTM0at-Y-P~NjjmcKElNkT7BtmbX6DkfmLizt9nZh-FIrKerSVWbXINxP7oQa7Lq7cD3fzuIj7XPQpyLIJ1UxfARYIDomP9XfHW8FHAc9mBPrMcHbBVMG1B0JZXwBBmHxpE44jU9O1tjsAk9W3Kbl0gAOeQ-KW86tIgljNfK5GFYqsz8XLZsK1Ma-JK7k6lkAk4j3CsfPzVd9vt6QARhv-lS7PETjNJsPz7UjAXIK-Fod8VmdlyOzGxUniEB8B3ENvOT9hxKJhFK~nY3EmyYPo92IJZ1k5MzagTlYODXepnOYN8aouDwE5~xVg2j9Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "945522c7-0060-4bf5-871c-579a414e71ec",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Estoy buscando otra ruta.</strong></p><p>Mostra o que você está fazendo para ajustar o percurso.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
